<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on UBS shares.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on UBS shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on Union Bank of Switzerland bearer shares.</p>
<p>Twenty warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1150 CHF		  PREMIUM	10.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.0 CHF		   GEARING	9.6 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 23.SEP.96-19.DEC.97   PAYDATE	23.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   ZURICH		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1150 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
